 quiet, but he misses his colleagues.","bank":["wearing","emails","different","colleagues","because","usually"]},{"t":"mcq","min":1,"title":"Como se diz em inglês?","items":[{"q":"Geralmente trabalho no escritório.","opts":["He never leaves early.","I'm writing a report.","I usually work at the office."],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Hoje estou trabalhando de casa.","opts":["What are you working on?","Today I'm working from home.","We're having a meeting."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Ela costuma beber chá.","opts":["He never leaves early.","What are you working on?","She usually drinks tea."],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"Agora ela está bebendo café.","opts":["I'm writing a report.","He never leaves early.","Now she's drinking coffee."],"ans":2,"say":null},{"q":"No que você está trabalhando?","opts":["Today I'm working from home.","What are you working on?","I'm writing a report."],"ans":1,"say":null},{"q":"Estou escrevendo um relatório.","opts":["Today I'm working from home.","I'm writing a report.","I usually work at the office."],"ans":1,"say":null}],"mode":"read"},{"t":"dict","min":2,"items":["She usually drinks tea.","Now she's drinking coffee.","What are you working on?","I usually answer emails."]},{"t":"write","min":3,"prompt":"Escreva 4 frases sobre sua rotina e 4 sobre o que está fazendo hoje.","frame":"I usually ... but today I'm ... She usually ... but now she's ...","words":["usually","now","today","at the moment","every day","this week","always","right now"]},{"t":"speak","min":3,"task":"Contraste: cada aluno diz 'I usually…, but today I'm…' com algo diferente.","hints":["I usually work at the office.","Today I'm working from home.","She usually drinks tea.","Now she's drinking coffee."]},{"t":"game","min":2,"title":"Jogo rápido","items":[{"q":"usually","opts":["geralmente","Estamos em reunião.","agora","Hoje estou trabalhando de casa."],"ans":0,"say":"usually"},{"q":"no momento","opts":["at the moment","She usually drinks tea.","I usually work at the office.",